Implemented MEDIUM serially. No subagents dispatched; no protected files read or modified.

**Changed files (only these):**
- `app/ranges.py` — validates outer list/tuple, pair shape, int-excluding-bool endpoints for every span (including zero-length) before dropping empties; sorts, coalesces overlap and adjacency, returns fresh lists, no mutation.
- `app/tags.py` — str-only, rejects ASCII controls U+0000..U+001F/U+007F, decodes only `\,` and `\\` (rejects trailing/unknown escapes), splits on unescaped commas, strips + Unicode casefolds + first-seen dedupe.
- `app/report.py` — `{"schema": 1, "intervals": merged, "covered": sum(end-start), "tags": parsed}`; ValueError propagates from either API.

